r should I say, <i>College Humour</i>?) web server gone sentient?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> true fae who tromenting the people on the show </div> </div> </div>I dunno. He usually tries to help people, and he's an oddball, but he's not that out of it, and he can understand when he's done something wrong. Maybe a Changeling with the Slewfoot Kith?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> now back to life as a sineater he wants to spread knowledge </div> </div> </div>That would explain &quot;Adam Ruins Death.&quot; He just wanted to make sure Emily passed on without leaving a ghost.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> mummy trying to make the shows characters hes cultists </div> </div> </div>Mummy is the hardest to justify, honestly. Unless he's managed to hit Apotheosis, it's odd that he's so frequently out-and-about, and so human in appearance and action, and even then that's a bit suspect.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> you guys fill in demoen for me please guys </div> </div> </div>Oh, that one writes itself. Analyst/Interrogator who's trying to make his friends into Stigmatics. The series finale will be &quot;Adam Ruins the Underlying Metaphysics of Reality.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>",